From b4c6b007f02164ba1d814fef50b662c16d61f4da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bruno Martins <bgcngm@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 23:42:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compat: Also adapt Bluetooth audio configurations for V4 callers

Follows the same logic as commit ba952fa0af4582aef9774228a765794c1fe3ca81.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: Ieb2b0a5a0b79d888daaa2bf78515335cb113d83f
---

